      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "lines": [
        9,
        9
      ],
      "raw": "Manage the lifecycle of options positions approaching or on expiration day. DriveWealth provides endpoints for submitting exercise instructions and do-not-exercise requests on behalf of accountholders, as well as retrieving the status of pending requests.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Manage the lifecycle of options positions approaching or on expiration day. DriveWealth provides endpoints for submitting exercise instructions and do-not-exercise requests on behalf of accountholders, as well as retrieving the status of pending requests.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "lines": [
        11,
        11
      ],
      "raw": "## Expiration risk",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Expiration risk",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "lines": [
        13,
        13
      ],
      "raw": "If a contract is in-the-money by at least $0.01 at expiration, it is subject to auto-exercise by the OCC. Due to the leveraged nature of options, exercising a contract can generate a large underlying equity position, exposing the account to substantial market risk overnight or over a weekend.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "If a contract is in-the-money by at least $0.01 at expiration, it is subject to auto-exercise by the OCC. Due to the leveraged nature of options, exercising a contract can generate a large underlying equity position, exposing the account to substantial market risk overnight or over a weekend.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "lines": [
        15,
        15
      ],
      "raw": "In cash accounts, sufficient buying power is required to cover the exercise of a long call, and sufficient shares are required to cover the exercise of a long put. Accounts that lack the necessary buying power or shares are at risk of a mistaken exercise resulting in a negative cash balance or short stock position.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "In cash accounts, sufficient buying power is required to cover the exercise of a long call, and sufficient shares are required to cover the exercise of a long put. Accounts that lack the necessary buying power or shares are at risk of a mistaken exercise resulting in a negative cash balance or short stock position.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "lines": [
        17,
        17
      ],
      "raw": "DriveWealth will attempt to take proactive action to prevent the exercise of option contracts that an account cannot support if they remain open after market close on expiration day.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "DriveWealth will attempt to take proactive action to prevent the exercise of option contracts that an account cannot support if they remain open after market close on expiration day.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "lines": [
        19,
        19
      ],
      "raw": "## Managing expiration risk",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Managing expiration risk",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "lines": [
        21,
        21
      ],
      "raw": "Before expiration day cutoff, verify that every account holding an options position has sufficient resources to support exercise:",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Before expiration day cutoff, verify that every account holding an options position has sufficient resources to support exercise:",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "lines": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "raw": "* For long calls: the account must have enough buying power to cover the purchase of the underlying stock.\n* For long puts: the account must have enough shares to cover the sale of the underlying stock.",
      "kind": "list",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "For long calls: the account must have enough buying power to cover the purchase of the underlying stock.For long puts: the account must have enough shares to cover the sale of the underlying stock.",
      "attrs": {
        "ordered": "false"
      },
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "transform",
        "note": "normalise `*`/`+` markers to `-`"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "lines": [
        26,
        26
      ],
      "raw": "If an account cannot support exercise, the position should be liquidated or a do-not-exercise request submitted before the cutoff.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "If an account cannot support exercise, the position should be liquidated or a do-not-exercise request submitted before the cutoff.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "lines": [
        28,
        28
      ],
      "raw": "Take weekends and market holidays into account — if expiration falls on a Friday or the day before a market holiday, the resulting equity position cannot be managed until the next trading day, increasing overnight market risk exposure.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Take weekends and market holidays into account — if expiration falls on a Friday or the day before a market holiday, the resulting equity position cannot be managed until the next trading day, increasing overnight market risk exposure.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "lines": [
        30,
        30
      ],
      "raw": "## DriveWealth risk mitigation",
