        34,
        34
      ],
      "raw": "## Exercise contract",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Exercise contract",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "lines": [
        36,
        36
      ],
      "raw": "Submit an exercise request to enact a transaction on the contract's underlying security. Exercise requests are processed immediately upon receipt — the option position is removed from the account and the resulting equity position is added. Requests can be submitted ahead of expiration day as an early exercise, or on expiration day itself prior to market close.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Submit an exercise request to enact a transaction on the contract's underlying security. Exercise requests are processed immediately upon receipt — the option position is removed from the account and the resulting equity position is added. Requests can be submitted ahead of expiration day as an early exercise, or on expiration day itself prior to market close.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "lines": [
