    {
      "i": 21,
      "lines": [
        72,
        72
      ],
      "raw": "Prevent an in-the-money option position from being auto-exercised by the OCC on expiration day.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Prevent an in-the-money option position from being auto-exercised by the OCC on expiration day.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "lines": [
        74,
        76
      ],
      "raw": "* DNE requests are only supported on expiration day and will be rejected if submitted in advance of expiration day.\n* Do-not-exercise requests are held and applied at market close — the quantity exercised will be reduced to the lesser of the requested quantity or the current position quantity.\n* Submitting a do-not-exercise request does not restrict trading out of the position prior to expiration.",
      "kind": "list",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "DNE requests are only supported on expiration day and will be rejected if submitted in advance of expiration day.Do-not-exercise requests are held and applied at market close — the quantity exercised will be reduced to the lesser of the requested quantity or the current position quantity.Submitting a do-not-exercise request does not restrict trading out of the position prior to expiration.",
